24", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_1007659528367157_7148746436769413295_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hmEgDWcfrVAQ7kNvwH0YRDG&_nc_oc=AdqaiduOJ4z9eWytMpOZ27silJPa0E2E0Z5JTvqvnL_ujdGZv1GrfyB9VDFzUZtKGng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSo2UgU9lVnPunujIjoVZzhNUmA1Yq1qooGzbuVSEq7jQ&oe=6AF342BF"}, {"file_name": "s3.png", "id": "1606992160396236", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823854_1606992163729569_3081853140841202823_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q3ep2PHbXL8Q7kNvwHOim-k&_nc_oc=AdoFTdnohBlKiyUovW2rIUa71y3MDPg_T_BPVNSXRdIJG300u95-BX1emIXKI426gxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQzYw7su6P9aIzR1xL6elPbQVFpSu0kaKOtaTv6ieQqcw&oe=6AF34CF5"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2056044485791419", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827960_2056044489124752_1300426442979872317_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8e8xvwZeAxMQ7kNvwEuOQM5&_nc_oc=AdrmFU0zcYoBCs3oZRkQumKCHPvro--LnvErpiXXyLQWxyo1IPRzXDzvZYSPlw2yoyg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRahqbXdkK_UAFkY9Rla5sY3RYaCHp9k492yOCw9kDuhQ&oe=6AF34233"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1541414840969897", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_1541414847636563_2863723104942724756_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M-_aHHAwaosQ7kNvwEt7cGj&_nc_oc=Adrb6BhQCuJ-fK8Tt_sBrwKIxyv7Uh4z_l_Ix5jHR03kVOfhqzs0oqI0Ipub7fXTvm0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSxC7yhbBfJdnc3wgh61uQCAWZ1K3O33-Ylp6hnAIr39Q&oe=6AF33720"}, "display_name": "Discovery: Rogue Planet", "keywords": ["FPS", "Adventure", "scifi", "shooter", "aliens"], "long_description": "Set on **Rogax, a hostile frontier planet** filled with dangerous creatures, abandoned settlements, guarded cities, forgotten mines, and eerie swamps.\n\nYou play as a bounty hunter trying to make a living in a world where survival is never guaranteed. Take on risky jobs, fight aggressive alien threats, explore hostile environments, and uncover the secrets hidden across the planet.\n\nKey Features\n\n* Full single-player VR campaign\n    A narrative-driven sci-fi shooter experience built for players who want a real campaign in VR.\n* First-person sci-fi combat\n    Battle strange creatures and hostile threats with immersive VR shooting.\n* Explore Rogax\n    Discover dusty outposts, guarded cities, abandoned settlements, forgotten mines, and eerie swamps.\n* Bounty hunter fantasy\n    Take on dangerous jobs and survive a world where people do not always play by the rules.\n* Mystery and discovery\n    Uncover the truth behind Rogax as each mission pulls you deeper into danger.\n\nSurvive the Frontier\n\nRogax is not a safe place.\n\nEvery job has a cost.\nEvery discovery has consequences.\nAnd every fight could be your last.", "short_description": "Step onto Rogax, a hostile frontier planet where every discovery leads to danger. Discovery: Rogue Planet is a story-driven sci-fi VR FPS where you fight alien creatures, explore deadly environments, and uncover the truth behind a mission gone wrong. \n\nBuilt in Unreal Engine, experience narrative, depth and immersion in the world of Rogax!"}]}, "developer_name": "Immersmind Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immersmind.com/privacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://immersmind.com/termsofservice.html", "publisher_name": "Immersmind Studio", "support_website_url": "https://www.immersmind.com/", "website_url": "https://immersmind.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "e